WEBVTT

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.270
Another day with no activity 
from Gekko, I see.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:24.550
Seriously.

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.960
They've been keeping their heads 
down these past two weeks.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.790
But at least we get a little peace and quiet!

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:31.970
Wait a minute.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.060
You're not allowed to stack draw cards!

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.250
It's legal where I come from!

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.060
<i>Yes... peace is best.</i>

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.620
No, it's cheating!

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:41.560
<i>No one wants to fight if they don't have to.</i>

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:42.730
<i>However...</i>

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:47.030
<i>If I don't fight, I won't 
be able to see Desumi-san!</i>

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.480
<b>Fudo~</b>

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.480
Fudo!

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:53.850
<b>MUSCLE</b>

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:53.850
<b>MUSCLE</b>

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:53.850
<b>Use my weight training 
regimen to reach the top!</b>

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.530
<i>I haven't had a proper night's sleep in weeks.</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.740
<b>Fudo</b>

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:52.190
<i>Fudo!</i>

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.850
<i>I'm going through serious 
Desumi-san withdrawal!</i>

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:54.740
<b>Fudo</b>

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:54.740
<i>Fudo...</i>

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.950
<i>I have to do something about this!</i>

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:05.500
<i>Signs of new weapon development 
in Gekko's headquarters detected.</i>

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:10.430
<i>I repeat, signs of new weapon development 
in Gekko's headquarters detected.</i>

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:09.330
Speak of the devil!

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:13.190
<i>The team is to infiltrate their base</i>

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:15.130
<i>and destroy the new weapon!</i>

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:17.650
An infiltration mission, eh?

00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:20.160
This isn't going to be easy.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:22.390
That's way too dangerous!

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:24.320
It's basically suicide!

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:27.170
But someone has to do it!

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:29.610
Pink and Blue are traveling.

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:32.320
Green is on paid leave.

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:37.240
It has to be either you 
or Fudo-kun, Misaki-kun!

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:42.870
And the other needs to remain here, 
just in case something happens.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:47.670
All right. I'll go—

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:49.720
I'll go!

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:50.800
Fudo-kun?!

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.750
Hang on! Don't you realize 
how dangerous this is?

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.070
I will go!

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:55.760
No...

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:57.630
I <i>must</i> go!

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:58.630
But...

00:01:58.630 --> 00:01:59.870
Misaki-kun...

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.230
Try to understand him!

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:07.810
He knows... He knows what he's doing!

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.340
Freezing Change!

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:11.360
<i>One!</i>

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:15.610
<i>Change Gelato!</i>

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:20.930
Red Gelato, Fudo Aikawa, departing!

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:24.660
Fudo!

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:26.750
You'd better come back, you hear me?!

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.720
He really is stupid.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:39.260
He is a true hero!

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:42.150
And now I'll get...

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:44.900
to see Desumi-san!

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:23.490
Episode 3     At Last, the Amusement Park

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:24.620
Pay respect to the Reaper Princess!

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.580
Welcome, Reaper Princess!

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:37.390
Dang, she's in a killer mood today.

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:40.550
She seems even more murderous than usual!

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:42.800
Bet she woke up on the wrong side of the bed!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.880
<i>No, that's not what this is.</i>

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.770
<i>I'm actually in agony.</i>

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:49.470
<i>Because...</i>

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:53.550
<i>I haven't seen Fudo in two whole weeks!</i>

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.140
<i>Desumi-san</i>

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:54.400
<i>Desumi-san!</i>

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.790
<i>Desumi-san... Desumi-san...</i>

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:58.610
Excuse me, combatants...

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.260
M-Ma'am!

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:04.990
When do you think we'll get 
to fight those heroes again?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.990
She's out for blood!

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:10.680
We do not know! Please forgive us!

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.870
Er, that's okay... I'm sorry.

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:21.340
I had a lousy horoscope this morning, too.

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:30.800
<b>L
E
O</b>

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:30.800
<b>You won't see the person
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hyou're waiting for.</b>

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:30.800
<b>Lucky Item</b>

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:30.800
<b>Pouch</b>

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:25.450
<i>Today's worst horoscope 
goes to you, my Leo friends!</i>

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:28.410
<b><i>D
O
O
M
.
.
.</i></b>

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.620
<i>You won't see the person you're waiting for.</i>

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:30.890
<i>Your lucky item is a cute little pouch!</i>

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.440
<i>Guess it didn't do any good.</i>

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.080
Ah, Reaper Princess!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.980
Culverin Bear-sama...

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:45.360
Behold! It's finished at last!

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:49.230
My new weapons, the Neo Culverin Cannons!

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:54.280
I'll use my new power 
to atomize those heroes!

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.470
That's quite a dangerous 
thing you've got there, too.

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:00.130
What?

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:02.270
It's just a pouch—

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.920
Say no more. I know exactly what it is.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:08.650
It holds concealed weapons!

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:09.930
Well, actually—

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:13.390
And the pouch's design is camouflage 
to get the enemy's guard down!

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.990
You're a terrifying woman, start to finish!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:28.200
<i>Maybe I'm just not a good fit for this stuff.</i>

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.110
Fu—

00:06:35.110 --> 00:06:36.040
Desumi-san!

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.720
I've been looking everywhere.

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:38.890
I've missed you!

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:39.790
Fudo...

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:43.880
I... I'm so happy to see you, too!

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:44.960
Wait, no!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.440
What do you think you're doing?!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:47.550
Reaper Princess
\h\h Dressing Room

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:47.670
Reaper Princess
 Dressing Room

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:47.800
Reaper Princess
 Dressing Room

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.550
Reaper Princess
 Dressing Room

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.180
Ah!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.480
So this is your dressing room?!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.930
It's as girly as I expected!

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.910
What were you thinking, Fudo?

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:59.240
This is extremely dangerous!

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:01.640
I just wanted to see you that badly!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:06.360
Well, I... I wanted to see you, too...

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.480
But this is still way too dangerous—

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:09.660
I know, Desumi!

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:10.910
You want to play this with me?

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:12.310
This.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:14.600
Y-Yes.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.180
Professor, any word from Fudo?

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:24.960
No, nothing yet.

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:27.470
I see...

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:31.380
For now, all we can do is have faith.

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:36.430
There! I win!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.050
And now for your punishment!

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:39.100
Hold out your hand!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:40.310
If you insist.

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:42.070
Here I go!

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.170
Your hand's so nice and warm.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.820
Don't say that! Now I can't do it!

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:52.200
<b>Oh so cute...</b>

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.200
<i>Oh so cute...</i>

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:54.190
<i>I have a report!</i>

00:07:54.190 --> 00:08:00.910
<i>Rea...per Prin...</i>

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:03.520
<i>...cess. It appears there's 
an intruder in the base!</i>

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:05.290
<i>We need to be on high alert!</i>

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.740
I'm aware of the situation.

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:08.390
Let's remain cautious.

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:09.750
<i>E-Excuse me...</i>

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.550
<i>I felt sure I saw a man there just—</i>

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:14.550
Your imagination, I'm sure.

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.390
<i>Yeah, I'll bet!</i>

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:19.980
<i>It's not like </i>you'd<i> ever be 
with a man, Reaper Princess!</i>

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:21.700
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.440
S-Sorry, Fudo!

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:27.180
Are you all right?!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.360
I'm coming in, Reaper—

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:33.860
—Prin...cess...

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.360
There's an intruder—

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.580
Oh, she's not here?

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:43.260
D-Desumi-san?

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.520
Oh, no...

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.240
I accidentally shut myself in with you!

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.920
W-Well...

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.910
It's kind of a tight fit.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:53.340
Stupid! Stop moving around!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:57.050
And there's something on my face 
that's making it hard to breathe.

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:00.060
I really need to take it off.

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:11.770
I got it off!

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.410
<i>New weapon signal lost!</i>

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.060
<i>Damage to Gekko's base confirmed as well!</i>

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:49.920
Did he do it?!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.820
Fudo, you're amazing!

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:02.120
Sorry to just drop in on 
you like that, Desumi-san.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:04.450
No, I'm the one who should apologize.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.590
You came all that way to see me,
 and I was a terrible host.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:10.870
Oh... Fudo, there's a cut on your cheek.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.780
Hey, it's all right.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.700
Come down here a minute.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:22.970
That should do it!

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:25.030
Thank you, Desumi-san.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.190
Hey, what a cute pouch!

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:29.980
It's perfect for you!

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:36.260
And... I wish I'd thought 
of this earlier, but...

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.530
Here. It's my phone number.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.340
Now we can talk any time we want to!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.180
Hey, Fudo...

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:50.690
Is it okay if I call you tonight?

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:52.170
<b>Bluuush</b>

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.170
<i>Oh so cute...</i>

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.170
<b>Oh so cute...</b>

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:54.490
Yes, of course!

00:10:56.670 --> 00:11:00.680
<b>Secret Society Gekko
Women's Dorm</b>

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:07.180
C-Calm down.

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.180
You're okay.

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:11.640
You're just calling to make 
sure he got home safe.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.550
A-All right!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.300
Yes? Aikawa residence!

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:30.230
<i>Mom, that call's for me!</i>

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:32.080
<i>What are you doing here, Fudo?</i>

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:33.800
<i>I told you to go out and buy milk!</i>

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:35.210
<i>Just give me the phone!</i>

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.420
Sorry, Desumi-san. It's me.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.420
<b>Who is it?</b>

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.420
Who is it?!

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:41.930
Fudo...

00:11:42.730 --> 00:11:44.390
Please buy a smartphone.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.510
<i>Yes, that might be best.</i>

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.980
Love After World Domination!

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:04.030
<i>Good morning.</i>

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.080
<i>It's time for the morning meeting.</i>

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.400
<i>All executives, please 
come to the meeting room.</i>

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.500
Good morning, all!

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:48.860
I am Supreme Leader Bosslar.

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:53.870
<b>Head of Secret Society Gekko
Supreme Leader Bosslar</b>

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:53.300
I believe it's time to begin 
our regular meeting.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:59.680
Your brave efforts have allowed us to
collect a steady supply of negative energy.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:02.650
Rejoice!

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:07.600
The birth of our monstrous culmination, 
Ultimate Phantom, is at hand!

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.350
<b>Allow me to explain!</b>

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.350
<i>Allow me to explain!</i>

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:13.730
<i>Secret Society Gekko, 
led by Supreme Leader Bosslar,</i>

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.480
<b>Negative</b>

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:17.480
Negative Energy

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:17.840
<i>uses the negative emotions 
of humans as a power source,</i>

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:19.770
<i>to create new monsters,</i>

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:24.440
Ultimate Phantom

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.840
<i>and further its goal of world domination!</i>

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.930
In the interest of collecting the 
remaining negative energy needed,

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:30.950
I will now take suggestions 
regarding our next target.

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:34.200
<b>Beast Princess</b>

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:34.200
Yes, Beast Princess?

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.090
Who the hell cares what our target is?

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:40.690
<b>Beast Princess</b>

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:40.690
<b>Gekko Princess Series
Beast Princess</b>

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.790
Just let us fight already!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.360
But the selection of the target 
is the purpose of this meeting.

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.460
You're as boorish as ever.

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:46.040
<b>Steel Princess</b>

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.040
Yes, Steel Princess?

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:51.030
<b>Gekko Princess Series
Steel Princess</b>

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:50.210
I require more time to consider the matter.

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:52.260
You didn't need to press the button for that!

00:13:52.530 --> 00:14:00.520
<b>Heat Princess</b>

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.190
Yes, Heat Princess.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:14:00.480
<b>Gekko Princess Series
 Heat Princess</b>

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.520
Say something already!

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:01.730
This is ridiculous.

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:04.220
Doesn't anyone have a real suggestion?!

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:07.110
Excellent! Reaper Princess!

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.380
A view of the city lights.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.510
<b>Reaper Princess</b>

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.030
That's far too abstract.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:12.110
Next—

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:14.700
An aquarium.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.620
It's difficult to fight indoors.

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:18.580
An amusement park!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:21.960
What's with you and date destinations?!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.130
Disappointment...

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.440
<b>Disappointment...</b>

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.020
Wait a moment, Bosslar-sama!

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:29.220
An amusement park <i>would</i> be filled 
with helpless, unsuspecting humans!

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.790
And we could have our fill, you mean?

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:36.170
That's a nasty little brain 
you've got, Reaper Princess.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:39.640
Very well.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:43.180
Our next target shall 
be... the amusement park!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.120
<b>Smartphones for Dummies!</b>

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.120
<b>Learn it all in just 10 minutes!</b>

00:14:55.120 --> 00:15:00.500
<b>Smartphones for Dummies!</b>

00:14:55.120 --> 00:15:00.500
<b>Learn it all in just 10 minutes!</b>

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:01.630
You have a new message

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:06.460
I'm still not used to that sound.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.550
<b>Desumi-san</b>

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.550
<b>Big Gelato</b>

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.550
It's from Desumi-san!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:16.560
Fudo! Rejoice!
 Gekko's next target is that theme park
 we've been wanting to go to, Yomiuriland!

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.240
Wh-What?!

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:21.540
I don't mind meeting up in old factories
 and quarries and places like that...

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:24.150
But I wish we could go to a proper 
couples' spot once in a while.

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:26.880
I agree. Like an aquarium!

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:29.020
Or a place with a view of the city lights!

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:30.820
A theme park would be awesome, too!

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:34.120
Of course, that's all a distant dream.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:42.760
<i>I can't believe that dream of a few 
days ago is coming true for us already!</i>

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:49.550
The attack will be Sunday, three days from now

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:49.550
<b>Can't wait!</b>

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:51.780
<i>Desumi-san leaks her organization's 
deepest-held secrets so casually.</i>

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.130
<i>That sweet little scatterbrain...</i>

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:54.820
<b>squee</b>

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.770
Okay, I'd better reply!

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.690
What? "Swipe"?!

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.980
Look at him fret!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.080
What in the world is he doing?

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.820
He apparently got his first 
smartphone yesterday.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:10.070
<i>Fudo</i> got a smartphone?!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.360
That bodybuilding gremlin got a smartphone?!

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.720
Impossible!

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:15.660
Hey, Suri!

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:23.500
Um... I... I'll come to the... like 
to come to... theme thark... Thunday.

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:27.820
W-Weather?! Tell me... t-tell 
weather. To me, please.

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.660
<i>I didn't catch that.</i>

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:32.300
<i>Something's going down here!</i>

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:37.920
<i>Fudo! Did you think you could hide from 
the mistress of meddling, Misaki?!</i>

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:43.100
<i>I can't wait until Sunday!</i>

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:49.340
<b>S
U
N
D
A
Y</b>

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:52.560
All right! Disguise complete!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:55.660
Now, let's get to the bottom 
of our little Fudo's secret!

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:57.390
m -55 11 l -52 58 49 56 49 11

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:57.390
<b>Good Mesh Cap
&
Good Towel</b>

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:59.400
We really shouldn't stalk 
him like this, Misaki-san.

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:02.200
I really don't think he's hiding anything.

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:05.990
If that's the way you feel,
 why'd you tag along?

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:10.050
I j-just want to stop you 
from doing anything reckless!

00:17:11.570 --> 00:17:12.740
Awesome! It's Red!

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:14.090
So cool!

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:14.090
It's really him!

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.650
What're you doing?

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:16.450
Patrolling.

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.250
Are you fighting Gekko?

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.290
I don't know yet.

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:21.770
But if anything happens, 
get to that shelter over there.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.920
Just remain calm, and do not panic.

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:24.990
Okay!

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:26.480
See? Look at that!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.370
He's patrolling, just like he always does!

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:33.680
He's devoted to world peace, 
just like I thought!

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:34.950
Well, we'll see.

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:37.140
I mean, he's still a guy.

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:38.240
Darn it!

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.560
How?!

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.750
How are there heroes here now?

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:45.360
Not just Red, but Pink and Yellow...

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:48.000
Did they know we'd be here somehow?

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:49.910
They don't leave us a choice.

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:52.980
Indeed. We'll have to retreat 
for now and regroup—

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:55.170
If they know we're here, 
we'll just have to fight!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.800
They don't know we're here yet, stupid!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.090
There you are, Desu—

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:02.650
I mean, Reaper Princess!

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:04.600
You really kept me waiting, Fudo—

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.520
I mean, Red!

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.540
Freezing Change!

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:08.350
<i>One!</i>

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:12.720
<i>Change Gelato!</i>

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:17.480
The aroma of strawberry, 
the flavor of justice!

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:19.530
Red Gelato!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.950
Awesome!

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:25.910
Now, everyone! Get to safety!

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.140
<b>smack</b>

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:30.500
I see you tracked us down, Gelato 5!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.500
Did he really just come here 
because he knew they'd attack?

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:36.460
Well, didn't I tell you?

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:39.200
Fudo-senpai isn't hiding anything!

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.010
I guess you're right.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.640
Freezing Change!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.010
<i>Three!</i>

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:46.480
<i>Four!</i>

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:48.070
Yellow Gelato!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.030
Pink Gelato!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:54.760
Let's call for help from Blue and Green!

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:55.990
Roger!

00:18:58.490 --> 00:18:59.610
Senpai!

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.490
We came to back you up!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:02.990
No! Stay back!

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:05.080
Don't worry about me!

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.370
I'm a hero, too!

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:15.270
You were totally right, Haru!

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:17.370
Fudo's the guy he's always been!

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:18.380
Right!

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:21.010
So honest and straightforward.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:24.010
Forthright and earnest in everything he does!

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:25.770
That's our leader!

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:28.770
<b>Here...</b>

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.170
<i>Here.</i>

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:28.770
<b>Sounds great...</b>

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:28.200
<i>Sounds great!</i>

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:31.020
<b><i>Hero Training Center</i></b>

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:32.830
Wh-What is it?

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:35.620
You're certainly talkative 
when the subject is Fudo!

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:39.120
H-Hey! I am not!

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:05.100
I didn't think rides would
give you motion sickness.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:08.430
I didn't know either, until today.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:12.230
There's not even that 
much motion. I'm pathetic.

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:15.120
D-Don't rock the car!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.070
Desumi-san?

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:23.260
I was just thinking... getting to know 
these hidden sides of each other...

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:26.630
It's kind of nice, Fudo.

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.280
Desumi-san...

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.460
Feeling a little better now?

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:42.600
Yes.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.730
<i>How mysterious.</i>

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:01.850
<i>I was so uncomfortable 
on this ride until now...</i>

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:06.440
<i>But now, I hope I never 
touch the ground again.</i>

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.310
Look, Fudo! It seems the battle's over.

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:14.400
You're right.

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:16.080
We'd better get back.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:22.760
<i>I think we might've crossed a line today.</i>

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.340
<i>The theme park is a fearsome place.</i>

00:22:56.930 --> 00:23:00.690
<b>Come feel the thrill with us again!</b>

00:22:58.870 --> 00:23:00.690
So much shopping!

00:23:00.690 --> 00:23:05.090
I'm so glad the guys are here 
to help me carry everything.

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:06.910
You bought way too much.

00:23:15.320 --> 00:23:18.180
Fudo-senpai?

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:21.950
Hello? Haruta-san?

00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:23.070
Listen to this!

00:23:23.070 --> 00:23:27.420
My boy bought me a dinosaur keychain 
from an amusement park he went to!

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:28.420
Honestly, that boy!

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.560
He never seems to grow up.

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:32.340
Now, on to the main topic!

00:23:32.820 --> 00:23:37.740
<i>He says episode 4 will be called 
"Could You Please Tell Me Why?"</i>

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:40.250
Episode 4     Could You Please Tell Me Why?

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:39.500
<i>Who's "Haruta-san"?</i>
